    "Subject": "Hai già attivato il nuovo portafoglio IT‑Wallet su IO?",
    "Html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"it\" dir=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\">\n  <head>\n    <title>Hai già attivato il nuovo portafoglio IT‑Wallet su IO?</title>\n    <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <!--<![endif]-->\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\n      #outlook a { padding:0; }\n      body { margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%; }\n      table, td { border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt; }\n      img { border:0;height:auto;line-height:100%; outline:none;text-decoration:none;-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic; }\n      p { display:block;margin:13px 0; }\n    </style>\n    <!--[if mso]>\n    <noscript>\n    <xml>\n    <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\n      <o:AllowPNG/>\n      <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>\n    </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\n    </xml>\n    </noscript>\n    <![endif]-->\n    <!--[if lte mso 11]>\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\n      .mj-outlook-group-fix { width:100% !important; }\n    </style>\n    <![endif]-->\n    \n      <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n        <link href=\"https://selfcare.pagopa.it/assets/font/selfhostedfonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n        <style type=\"text/css\">\n          @import url(https://selfcare.pagopa.it/assets/font/selfhostedfonts.css);\n        </style>\n      <!--<![endif]-->\n\n    \n    \n    <style type=\"text/css\">\n      @media only screen and (min-width:480px) {\n        .mj-column-per-100 { width:100% !important; max-width: 100%; }\n      }\n    </style>\n    <style media=\"screen and (min-width:480px)\">\n      .moz-text-html .mj-column-per-100 { width:100% !important; max-width: 100%; }\n    </style>\n    \n    \n  \n    \n    <style type=\"text/css\">\n\n    @media only screen and (max-width:479px) {\n      table.mj-full-width-mobile { width: 100% !important; }\n      td.mj-full-width-mobile { width: auto !important; }\n    }\n  \n    </style>\n     \n    <style type=\"text/css\">\n:root {\n  color-scheme: light dark;\n  supported-color-schemes: light dark;\n}\n\nbody,\n.mail-body {\n  background-color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n\n.header {\n  background-color: #FFFFFF;\n  /* border-top: 8px solid #0073E6; */\n}\n\n.section {\n  background-color: #FFFFFF;\n}\n\n.title div {\n  /* Text Primary */\n  color: #17324D !important;\n}\n\n.text div {\n  /* Text Primary */\n  color: #17324D !important;\n}\n\n.text-secondary,\n.text-secondary div {\n  /* Text Secondary */\n  color: #5C6F82 !important;\n}\n\np {\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.text-secondary a,\n.text a {\n  color: #0073E6 !important;\n}\n\n.link {\n  color: #0073E6 !important;\n}\n\n.divider p {\n  border-color: #E3E7EB !important;\n}\n\n/* Message Preview Block */\n\n.message-preview {\n  background-color: #FAFAFA;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {\n\n  .dark-img,\n  [data-ogsc] .dark-img {\n    display: none !important;\n    mso-hide: all !important;\n  }\n\n  .light-img,\n  [data-ogsc] .light-img {\n    display: block;\n    display: block !important;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 600px) {\n\n  .mobile {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .desktop {\n    display: block;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n\n  body,\n  .mail-body {\n    background-color: #323232;\n  }\n\n  .header {\n    background-color: #323232;\n    /* border-top: 8px solid #3da2ff; */\n  }\n\n  .section {\n    background-color: #323232;\n  }\n\n  .message-preview {\n    background-color: #424242;\n  }\n\n  .divider p {\n    border-color: #757575 !important;\n  }\n\n  .title div {\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n\n  .text div {\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n\n  .text-secondary,\n  .text-secondary div {\n    /* Gray-200 */\n    color: #E0E0E0 !important;\n  }\n\n  .text-secondary a,\n  .text a {\n    color: #3da2ff !important;\n  }\n\n  .link {\n    color: #3da2ff !important;\n  }\n\n  .cta table td,\n  .cta table td>a {\n    background-color: #3da2ff !important;\n  }\n\n  /* IMAGES */\n  /* Source: https://www.litmus.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-dark-mode-for-email-marketers/ */\n\n  .dark-img,\n  [data-ogsc] .dark-img {\n    display: block !important;\n    overflow: visible !important;\n    float: none !important;\n    line-height: auto !important;\n    margin-top: 0px !important;\n    visibility: inherit !important;\n  }\n\n  .light-img,\n  [data-ogsc] .light-img {\n    display: none;\n    display: none !important;\n    mso-hide: all !important;\n  }\n}\n    </style>\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html\" charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n      <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\" />\n      <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\" />\n  </head>\n  <body style=\"word-spacing:normal;\">\n    \n    \n      <div\n         aria-label=\"Hai già attivato il nuovo portafoglio IT‑Wallet su IO?\" aria-roledescription=\"email\" class=\"mail-body\" style=\"\" role=\"article\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"auto\"\n      >\n        \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\" ><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n    \n      \n      <div  style=\"margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;\">\n        \n        <table\n           align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;\"\n        >\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td\n                 style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:20px 0;padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px;text-align:center;\"\n              >\n                <!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><![endif]-->\n                  \n      <!-- App IO Logo -->\n          <!--[if mso | IE]><tr><td class=\"header-outlook\" width=\"600px\" ><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"header-outlook\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:560px;\" width=\"560\" ><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n    \n      \n      <div  class=\"header\" style=\"margin:0px auto;max-width:560px;\">\n        \n        <table\n           align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;\"\n        >\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td\n                 style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:center;\"\n              >\n                <!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:top;width:560px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div\n         class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\"\n      >\n        \n      <table\n         border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" width=\"100%\"\n      >\n        <tbody>\n          \n              <tr>\n                <td\n                   align=\"left\" class=\"light-img\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-left:0;word-break:break-word;\"\n                >\n                  \n      <table\n         border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;\"\n      >\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td  style=\"width:36px;\">\n              \n      <img\n         alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pagopa/io-app-email-templates/assets-v1.0.0/assets/logo_app_io.png\" style=\"border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;\" width=\"36\" height=\"auto\"\n      />\n    \n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            <div\n        class=\"dark-img\"\n        style=\"mso-hide: all; display: none; padding: 10px 0px\"\n      >\n        <img\n          src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pagopa/io-app-email-templates/assets-v1.0.0/assets/logo_app_io_white.png\"\n          width=\"36px\"\n          class=\"dark-img\"\n          style=\"display: none\"\n        />\n      </div>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n      </div>\n    \n          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n      </div>\n    \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"section-outlook\" width=\"600px\" ><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"section-outlook\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:560px;\" width=\"560\" ><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n    \n      \n      <div  class=\"section\" style=\"margin:0px auto;max-width:560px;\">\n        \n        <table\n           align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;\"\n        >\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td\n                 style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;padding-bottom:8px;text-align:center;\"\n              >\n                <!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:top;width:560px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div\n         class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\"\n      >\n        \n      <table\n         border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" width=\"100%\"\n      >\n        <tbody>\n          <!-- Title & Main Message -->\n              <tr>\n                <td\n                   align=\"left\" class=\"title\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:24px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;\"\n                >\n                  \n      <div\n         style=\"font-family:Titillium Web, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1;text-align:left;color:#17324D;\"\n      ><!-- H4 Desktop (from MUI Italia)-->\n            <h1 style=\"font-size: 32px; line-height: 36px; margin: 0\">\n              Hai già attivato il nuovo portafoglio IT‑Wallet su IO?\n            </h1></div>\n    \n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            \n              <tr>\n                <td\n                   align=\"left\" class=\"text\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;\"\n                >\n                  \n      <div\n         style=\"font-family:Titillium Web, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:regular;line-height:24px;text-align:left;color:#17324D;\"\n      ><!-- Body 1 Desktop (from MUI Italia)-->\n            <p>\n              Ciao,\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              hai già attivato IT‑Wallet sull’app IO? Se non l’hai ancora fatto,\n              è il momento di scoprire tutte le novità!\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Oltre a Patente di guida, Tessera Sanitaria e Carta Europea della\n              Disabilità, puoi ora aggiungere su IO\n              <strong>nuovi documenti digitali</strong>, come l’attestato di\n              residenza, i titoli di studio, la frequenza scolastica, le\n              iscrizioni accademiche e altri in arrivo.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Puoi usare i tuoi documenti digitali per le verifiche dal vivo o\n              per accedere ai servizi di enti pubblici e privati che aderiscono\n              al sistema IT‑Wallet, semplicemente con il tuo telefono.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Inoltre, <strong>solo sull’app IO</strong> la tua Patente digitale\n              è valida anche come <strong>documento di riconoscimento</strong>.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              <strong>Attiva ora IT‑Wallet</strong>: ti bastano pochi minuti e\n              la tua Carta d'Identità Elettronica (CIE).\n            </p></div>\n    \n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            \n              <tr>\n                <td\n                   align=\"left\" class=\"cta\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;\"\n                >\n                  \n      <table\n         border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse:separate;line-height:100%;\"\n      >\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td\n               align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#0073E6\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:auto;mso-padding-alt:14px 24px;background:#0073E6;\" valign=\"middle\"\n            >\n              <a\n                 href=\"https://continua.io.pagopa.it/itw/discovery/info\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0073E6;color:white;font-family:Titillium Web, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;line-height:120%;margin:0;text-decoration:none;text-transform:none;padding:14px 24px;mso-padding-alt:0px;border-radius:4px;\" target=\"_blank\"\n              >\n                Attiva IT-Wallet su IO\n              </a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            \n              <tr>\n                <td\n                   align=\"left\" class=\"text\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;\"\n                >\n                  \n      <div\n         style=\"font-family:Titillium Web, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:regular;line-height:24px;text-align:left;color:#17324D;\"\n      ><p>\n              <strong>Vuoi saperne di più?</strong><br />\n              Visita il\n              <a\n                href=\"https://io.italia.it/documenti-su-io/faq/\"\n                style=\"color: #0073e6\"\n                class=\"link\"\n                >sito di IO, l’app dei servizi pubblici</a\n              >\n              o consulta il\n              <a\n                href=\"https://assistenza.ioapp.it/hc/it\"\n                style=\"color: #0073e6\"\n                class=\"link\"\n                >Centro assistenza di IO</a\n              >\n            </p></div>\n    \n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            \n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n      </div>\n    \n          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n      </div>\n    \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table></td></tr><![endif]-->\n        <!-- Divider -->\n          <!--[if mso | IE]><tr><td class=\"section-outlook\" width=\"600px\" ><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"section-outlook\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:560px;\" width=\"560\" ><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n    \n      \n      <div  class=\"section\" style=\"margin:0px auto;max-width:560px;\">\n        \n        <table\n           align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;\"\n        >\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td\n                 style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:center;\"\n              >\n                <!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:top;width:560px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div\n         class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\"\n      >\n        \n      <table\n         border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" width=\"100%\"\n      >\n        <tbody>\n          \n              <tr>\n                <td\n                   align=\"center\" class=\"divider\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:0px;padding-top:16px;padding-bottom:16px;word-break:break-word;\"\n                >\n                  \n      <p\n         style=\"border-top:solid 1px #E3E7EB;font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\"\n      >\n      </p>\n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 1px #E3E7EB;font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:560px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"560px\" ><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            \n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n      </div>\n    \n          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n      </div>\n    \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table></td></tr><![endif]-->\n        <!-- Footer -->\n          <!--[if mso | IE]><tr><td class=\"section-outlook\" width=\"600px\" ><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"section-outlook\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:560px;\" width=\"560\" ><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n    \n      \n      <div  class=\"section\" style=\"margin:0px auto;max-width:560px;\">\n        \n        <table\n           align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;\"\n        >\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td\n                 style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;\"\n              >\n                <!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"\" style=\"vertical-align:top;width:560px;\" ><![endif]-->\n            \n      <div\n         class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\"\n      >\n        \n      <table\n         border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" width=\"100%\"\n      >\n        <tbody>\n          \n              <tr>\n                <td\n                   align=\"left\" class=\"text-secondary\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:0px;word-break:break-word;\"\n                >\n                  \n      <div\n         style=\"font-family:Titillium Web, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:regular;line-height:20px;text-align:left;color:#5C6F82;\"\n      ><p>\n        Ricevi questo messaggio perché hai un’utenza attiva su app IO.\n      </p>\n      <p>\n          Non rispondere a questa email: l’indirizzo non è monitorato e non riceveresti risposta.\n          Se non vuoi più ricevere comunicazioni come questa \n          <a\n            href=\"{{amazonSESUnsubscribeUrl}}\"\n            style=\"color: #0073e6\"\n            class=\"link\"\n            >Disiscriviti</a\n          >\n      </p></div>\n    \n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            \n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    \n      </div>\n    \n          <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n      </div>\n    \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        \n      </div>\n    \n      \n      <!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    \n    \n      </div>\n    \n  </body>\n</html>",
    "Text": "Hai già attivato il nuovo portafoglio IT‑Wallet su IO?\n\nCiao,\n\nhai già attivato IT‑Wallet sull’app IO? Se non l’hai ancora fatto, è il momento di scoprire tutte le novità!\n\nOltre a Patente di guida, Tessera Sanitaria e Carta Europea della Disabilità, puoi ora aggiungere su IO nuovi documenti digitali, come l’attestato di residenza, i titoli di studio, la frequenza scolastica, le iscrizioni accademiche e altri in arrivo.\n\nPuoi usare i tuoi documenti digitali per le verifiche dal vivo o per accedere ai servizi di enti pubblici e privati che aderiscono al sistema IT‑Wallet, semplicemente con il tuo telefono.\n\nInoltre, solo sull’app IO la tua Patente digitale è valida anche come documento di riconoscimento.\n\nAttiva ora IT‑Wallet: ti bastano pochi minuti e la tua Carta d'Identità Elettronica (CIE).\n\nAttiva IT-Wallet su IO: https://continua.io.pagopa.it/itw/discovery/info\n\nVuoi saperne di più?\nVisita il sito di IO, l’app dei servizi pubblici (https://io.italia.it/documenti-su-io/faq/) o consulta il Centro assistenza di IO (https://assistenza.ioapp.it/hc/it).\n\n---\n\nRicevi questo messaggio perché hai un’utenza attiva su app IO.\n\nNon rispondere a questa email: l’indirizzo non è monitorato e non riceveresti risposta. Se non vuoi più ricevere comunicazioni come questa disiscriviti: {{amazonSESUnsubscribeUrl}}"
  }
}
